    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何かの力で
封印されているようだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's sealed by some
power or other.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>死を暗示する方位には、
破壊を司る者を招くがよい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The direction suggested by the
dead beckons that which governs
Destruction.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>This is from TOPX, need to check for accuracy</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>65</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>生命の息吹を感じたなら、
そこは誕生の司る者の場所である</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Where one feels the breath of life
is the place for that which governs
Birth.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>This is from TOPX, need to check for accuracy</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>65</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>逝く者に涙する乙女は
死を左手に感ずる者に招かれよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The maiden who mourns the
departed beckons the feeling of
death to her left hand.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>This is from TOPX, need to check for accuracy</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>65</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>風は乙女と向かい、
時の流れのように等しく
みなに吹き抜ける</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When wind flows toward the
maiden, it blows itself out with
equal force.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>This is from TOPX, need to check for accuracy</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>65</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エト助がいねーから
なんて書いてあるか読めねーべさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ethos isn't here, so no one
can read whatever it is
what's written on there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>etosuke</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>69</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>土と言えば、地の加護を
受け取るところかの～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The best place for soil
might be somewhere with
the blessings of earth~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>70</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
